WEBVTT

00:03:28.821 --> 00:03:32.712
Bu muallif o'z boshidan
kechirgan tarixdir.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:37.697
Gabriel Garsiya Markes konservativ 
va liberal siyosiy partiyalar o'rtasidagi

00:03:37.697 --> 00:03:40.907
fuqarolik urushidan parchalangan 
Kolumbiyada voyaga yetgan.

00:03:40.907 --> 00:03:43.395
U, shuningdek, avtoritar 
Meksikada yashagan va

00:03:43.395 --> 00:03:47.991
1958-yil jurnalist sifatida Venesueladagi 
davlat to'ntarishini yoritgan. Ammo

00:03:47.991 --> 00:03:52.366
ona tomondan buvi-buvasi uning ijodiga eng
katta ta'sir ko'rsatgan bo'lsa ajab emas.

00:03:52.366 --> 00:03:57.141
Bobosi Nikolas Rikardo Markes 
Ming Kunlik Urush qahramoni bo'lib,

00:03:57.141 --> 00:04:01.086
uning Kolumbiya konservativ hukumatiga 
qarshi isyonlar haqidagi hikoyalari